  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support to the Ministry of Interior of Montenegro to Upgrade Central Registry of Citizens</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the existing efforts of the Government of Montenegro to improve its data management system in line with the Law on Administrative Procedure. It is aimed at the improvement of the overall functionality of the system through the of the existing functions and addition of new functions. This will facilitate overall data management and provision of services to both, clients and respective government institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
